id: CTB-SRC0033-order
source: SRC-0033
section: §6.4
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000230
text: The order of work, each step permanent, is: first, invariants I1 to I3 enforced for the launch scope; second, the first-marketplace journeys reach Verified end to end; third, governance in CI, with the Master in the repository and rule R7 active; fourth, generalisation through registered extension points as needs are registered.
